      "id": "about",
      "slug": "about",
      "title": "The Story of Hotel 77",
      "content": "### Comfort & Hospitality in Shreegaun, Jakhera, Lamahi\n\nLocated in the peaceful surroundings of Shreegaun, Jakhera, Lamahi, Dang, Nepal, **Hotel 77** offers a comfortable and welcoming stay for travelers, families, and business guests.\n\n### Our Philosophy\nWe believe great hospitality begins with genuine care. We provide clean, comfortable accommodations and friendly service.\n\n### Why Choose Hotel 77?\n* Comfortable Standard, Deluxe, and Family Suite rooms\n* Free High-Speed Wi-Fi\n* Daily housekeeping\n* Peaceful environment\n* Ample parking\n* Excellent value for money",
      "last_updated": "2026-07-18"
    }
